# Build artifacts
build/
bin/
out/
.gradle/
*.class
*.jar
# ...but the Gradle wrapper jar must ship: without it a fresh clone cannot run
# ./gradlew at all (ClassNotFoundException: GradleWrapperMain). Committing it is
# what lets someone build with no Gradle installed, which is the wrapper's whole point.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

